A contact can have many things member variables:
Contact:
    Name
    Phone
    Email
    Flags -> 0001 = Favorite, 0010 = Work, 0100 = Family, 1000 = Has phone (Because we are learning things otherwise this could be a simpler variable and not a bit flag)

So with the flags I would need more functions like
1. Toggle favorite
2. Toggle work


